{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1384,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11dad9adde565b728280c687",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢哦。\r\n你的助威，我收到了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1a87524895b50c0c0f392380d2273b576f0edc3d50d553f8c8a8b212c176be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:731495042e42cc9bcd110bd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能走到这一步呢～。\r\n助威的力量好强大啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de5051bb6061f17d95b8349122cd45e547060024774a2703294ba235ffca323",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e3319ed9a57efc59dea51e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "初夢よりも見たかった夢、見られたよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0144ce2d55c49045e0421acb98ff16ff3a3e5cbb4b9301c4188b088854bfabe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86541771c433e0abc867f2bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょっとは晴れやかなアタシ、見せられたかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ac7320ebdefb311b0192b721689a78a1751ce0b567bf2e85ec92ae2ca2d0c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1b68a896599e164f59f820",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想，报答你照顾过我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b77d3e3cbe5a35c03eebbcb1be99be661976129dc6b8a3cf8c57acf527ba8549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6eb04b8ec4248537e8a8dcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，磨练过后才会发光呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "818d672bd102a3854971689651c32853c55dff81182e7cfd526ececf9c0274a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2974b27f90fd42f49a82609f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟，我是优秀素质～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3aa48097820804e0532654fb8e32a55fcfb5944a1cf6282555e4e9d8377bedc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2350a06ec8d55c1b5ccfd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只是衬托其他人的话，还是项简单的工作嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e6e1ed0ab1b878902945790c379f3940804c15f4d10a3a357054f613c7af137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51327e83a8cad944560a5734",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会多管闲事的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a380c94ec083727398c7e60fa3e30ac648b456c4247586df065b7a15acbae9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2ee0aa7602a77d3c817ba30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "One・Two・Step・Up！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50165f7233cab5f1f1bccf7560bd8d6705ce1be06e105397bb5f74f3c2d93afa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2617ca0c9c4c45ea4bfcc1e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "保持这样\r\nPompon地加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b2afadb5418a1332a94c9b7812e987e8b1fad72152d9327f6a89b85597ff05d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c05176b4bc6743e143ef736",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有干劲了嘛～…不对，拿出干劲吧！\r\nGo Fight Win！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b14445101e21ba4e1645ab30c0ebdbe19eb6b64da79a912702a13ce648afc74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4934660fffba0593fd278959",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是优秀素质。\r\n加油助威之类的就请自便吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "598513db60bd354399dff301049c060e88a01691b333687eb24fdca19a32e11a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c5b27364e32ac562dd85d05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "日の出みたく、あったまってきたよー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f82215ec9f1b9d1a4cac3869d16cd92d781a1a9d1dd85f6e420cfa0faa5624c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d598b3c7ef6bcff211ff62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新たに幕開けしちゃいますか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "104872d150a2b06021b4bcc926a40f15593d0cfc8c32a812d853f105fbf9777c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479c054f101aeccf34ab874b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "笑って過ごせる年にしたいから。\r\n今年こそ…いちばん上を、ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d545e7a176e2fcad346713a726289cd6648d5a514d6530b0cd31171d70bde6de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba0b85e7ac1a780f71648e59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ナイスネイチャでーす。\r\nあ、みかんでも食べます？",
      "source_fingerprint": "85d145566ee0b52fc3e76b20287a26a33edb371782296681d8ec505e1cf6e512",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1060",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4072519cb389674d5a34655d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你见识我的实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a65a765d986a667eaec9de0eb092d342e5cd6d223f461ceeb5a42434a68d7e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bb898da0eb6f777b036a307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么时候都不能\r\n摆出想睡觉的样子哦。抬头挺胸，\r\n不是要一起背负一流的责任吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fc0844e2b3d1d1fdfa82a2d45bdc066843836164e13e2ac9569e57c7337f191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c694559b6913fe3c31fe611",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb0b2f99aa5dcf0630f5575e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d9f2c221a037f0a2eb9da22145532ea4b422af42c29694227631ad74c073f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:390b9641dac4be94f4eeddd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你可是我认可的\r\n我的签约训练员诶？\r\n言行举止上要更注意不要失态才好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f70a1d2083d92445269cbe54c87c8c855c1d1c7ee4dae3ac243c92ca59f28245",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13918977100e5031592cb0e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，我和母亲是不一样的！\r\n料理我也……\r\n还会做玉子烧呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30653a7399fba295683dd78cdb85ea42cd36250ecdf1425901383735372f5b35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c8ec8ccced79762181ea558",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，新年快乐。\r\n新年一早就这么努力很值得敬佩，\r\n今年一整年也都要这么勤勉哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b5ec6d85e4c014849155a4e81d4f5a69aaf8ea91960f55682a606f725ab1b1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e3cc6c9f4ef5e904d2b6531",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！\r\n为了感谢平时的种种照顾……\r\n赋予你送巧克力给圣王的权利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0137d9e12c8e1d4eea2f73ab230f0789fc04d3301c1cded71abbb162ec0afa6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:670949b84b2befc10cf94e01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "所以呢？你有准备巧克力吗？\r\n……再不快点就来不及\r\n跟我交换巧克力了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5243eec8a7314116fbbc5e8e309d7b227450c62972d254e737ae05d4f6e44ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a375822eb93d06aee4da0de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "牛郎跟织女都还是小孩子吧。\r\n竟然只会乖乖遵守父母的话。\r\n不会直接过河算了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e18d1542a838fa93827820e10b1391536094efaf66d46738af0bd958d0a7f873",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46f32576845253b138e22c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋！\r\n我不但要讨点心，还要恶作剧！\r\n全部都交到圣王手中吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d3f9539da35508d497beb0a177b4f3927016ed395d50c50a09c39f28ec8ac4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07ea6ed0a51119096ea9b608",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐，训练员。\r\n放心吧，我已经自己挑好礼物了。\r\n你就只需要负责去买就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71e2640e65f94406f8cdbf645368aee8cb6534dd9bd28c9d4c2266f692b5e37e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9d67ec1d3de3a36d771a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，你的房间我\r\n也已经帮你装饰好了。\r\n呵呵，今晚要通宵派对哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d918f86bd22f5088540b1961f7c11fa8f362ff1249175a12c2da672dd2ee059",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50572ad42979940faa5f9f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是堪称一流的结果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b309eccb8e3901d8a53f1a499aef036cb26ad0a54a0c5ca359759c87b186c75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1bb0afc0b94d69f6a6c3ca7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也已经要结束了吗……\r\n但，反正明年也是\r\n属于圣王的一年就是了！呵呵",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed2840bc0341665a10880bace34aab6f77752e43c59caeac9e3025d802af806f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b33b5cad45d007b7aabc100",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，生日快乐。\r\n……哼，我怎么可能会忘记你的生日。\r\n我可是一流的赛马娘哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "71192d0987ced00b64e50f06fe4bd9ba5791444b138e2a97974201ceb63e7873",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d766888f3ba37a65691be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论到了几岁，\r\n都还是会有所成长的呢。\r\n……我也可以稍微向你看齐啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa3c50de9eb841a1d0c97fd00b3a7b6a4c72d50c6b8dadebd9a4288fffb712fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0da02a4257819c14acf4ccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐啊我！\r\n快点快点，再大声一点啊！\r\n这可是我的出生纪念日哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad1817f6fe7416a83f91fc35a52764799362f84e0aa6fdbfb75f5b66f54ab9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ca12490f0eb9899a5ab54c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天圣王的行程几乎都空出来了。\r\n可以一起庆祝我特别的日子，\r\n你要感到高兴才是！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d8b00d477c57d76752a0c5e72e2b6040595f191e99efd2ab2427dd03edb264a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d8eb1f7937f1621930b0f2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有看新公告吗？\r\n一定要好好了解最新的潮流哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce64b617af30232fd499a5cf37dcbe854890a1ff2576e2ad15685a3916f28054",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08aba4a7dba023656985d61f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，好像有礼物送来了。\r\n呵呵……赋予你代替圣王\r\n拆礼物的权利吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "715950f3a23500cb716c3b70749ba3e080da645ffeccdccd77e73da0069121fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c65db3511ee989aa19487bd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像达成任务了。\r\n看来你也是有在努力的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53dd711290d8d1f2e6da41ef3081c2d22fec87bb6cb0ea46fdf7c3f29143fecb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9f915c7a7e8bb1907ad5d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？好像有活动快要\r\n开始了呢……快点，我们要赶在\r\n大家有所动作之前准备好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c9e4da9e46d4395ce20dffc0a74199430af5fd160883f7ca7cd9887cd40d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:129d6cad1f2eaead4d5b5ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是活动，圣王也要全力以赴！\r\n身为我的训练员，你当然也要！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4831f77be08f3c26d0ae30256248ccd8e391943ade8d67c2ac5f0ad743e325c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc21608efa44e9c3735e333c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到我竟然会输ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d14016572ab8f9c9a8c386f1ed44a86526b875649c39263c9f945bb692256c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bafc4e65f01e1a7d7dbf1aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14330309b30c9be11a6a192042ef4819affeba365efaacc70b3d85cbafc87e4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6878915b5913d2ec8ea9ca63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由一流职人用一流布料，\r\n为我量身打造的这件衣服……\r\n最符合帝王的格调！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae33e75ef1b0a338ab0bee1909e15f0d7e7dd290ca137b3671cf98b43fe2add",
